The controls for "The Onslaught Continues!" are:

        Z - move left
        X - move right
        ' - move up
        / - move down
    space - fire

There is no joystick control, as I don't have the necessary hardware to play with. Your joystick may come with software to emulate keypresses (didn't it used to do that? I'm not sure...). Maybe that'll work.

There are a couple of alterations and enhancements, but I'll leave them for you to find. Needless to say, there is not much point in sending a disc with your highscores on to A&F Software in the hope of winning the big prize (sorry!). Don't send them to me either, I'm just a poor student and I don't have £200 spare...

Have fun,

